      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">INT. FARMHOUSE KITCHEN - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">She sets the envelope on the table and slides it across.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">HARLAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">It was never about the money.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="112" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="56" Title="">
        <Summary>Gravel Driveway beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">EXT. GRAVEL DRIVEWAY - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">He turns the letter opener over in his hands, weighing it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">JANITOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sign it and we're done.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="113" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="57" Title="">
        <Summary>Harlan'S Study beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">INT. HARLAN'S STUDY - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">He turns the letter opener over in his hands, weighing it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">DEPUTY COLE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Nobody's coming, Harlan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="114" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="57" Title="">
        <Summary>Wheat Field beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">EXT. WHEAT FIELD - DUSK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Dust hangs in the light from the window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">JANITOR (CONT'D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">I know what you did out there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="115" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="58" Title="">
        <Summary>County Sheriff'S Office beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">INT. COUNTY SHERIFF'S OFFICE - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">The screen door bangs shut behind her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">DEPUTY COLE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">You should have called first.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="116" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="58" Title="">
        <Summary>Pickup Truck - Moving beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">INT. PICKUP TRUCK - MOVING - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">She sets the envelope on the table and slides it across.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">DEPUTY COLE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">I know what you did out there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="117" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="8/8" Page="59" Title="">
        <Summary>Grain Silo beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="3" Size="12" Style="">EXT. GRAIN SILO - DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">He </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="3" Size="12" Style="">turns the letter opener over in his hands, weighing it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">JANITOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="3" Size="12" Style="">I know what you did out there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="117A" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="59" Title="">
        <Summary>Diner beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="2" Size="12" Style="">INT. DINER - MORNING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">He </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="2" Size="12" Style="">pockets the brass key without looking at it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">JANITOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">(quietly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="2" Size="12" Style="">You should have called first.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="118" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="0/8" Page="59" Title=""/>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">OMITTED</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="119" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <Summary>Hospital Corridor beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">INT. HOSPITAL CORRIDOR - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Dust hangs in the light from the window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">MAE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sign it and we're done.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="120" Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <Summary>Cemetery beat.</Summary>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">EXT. CEMETERY - AFTERNOON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">The truck idles at the end of the drive, headlights off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">HARLAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sign it and we're done.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">FADE OUT.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

